  Consequence: the script reports `MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html not found` or edits a same-named file in the current directory instead of the repo-root target.

- **values compared/reported AS TEXT where line endings differ**: lines 72, 85, and 93.  
  Exact input: LF-only `MDRTB_BPAL_REVIEW.html` containing exactly `alpha\nbeta\n` on Windows.  
  Consequence: the run rewrites line endings to CRLF while reporting `Size delta: +0 bytes`, so a no-op can still dirty the file.

No finding: idempotency guard satisfied by own comment/marker.  
